                "type": "text",
                "text": "“Saturday's fixture between Riverside Rovers and Hillcrest Town kicked off at three. Hillcrest scored early, but Rovers equalised just before half-time. In the second half, Rovers' captain scored twice. It finished three-one to Rovers, and the supporters stayed on the pitch-side to celebrate. The club's fundraiser for the new changing rooms is next Friday at the community centre.”",
